    {
      "id": "note",
      "kind": "note",
      "x": 1152,
      "y": 48,
      "label": "",
      "props": {
        "text": "Workers talk to the Run API (claim, heartbeat, complete) and the runs store feeds the history index by change stream; those edges are not drawn so Run mode does not route the scheduler's traffic through them. Run mode enters all traffic at the owners client and holds the hour-mark rate for the whole run, so the dispatch queues fill: real bursts last about 5 s and are absorbed by pre-warmed worker slots."
      }
